                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.248/162: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in the United
                        Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Winant</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-12-09T21:00:00-05:00">December 9, 1941—9
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>5791. Your 5752, November 29, 4 p.m. More detailed communication urgently
                    awaited.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
